RecAgent-Eval is independently implemented and maintained by Sh1njuuovo.

RecAgent-Eval is an independent implementation inspired by the tool-oriented
recommendation workflow in Microsoft RecAI / InteRecAgent:
https://github.com/microsoft/RecAI/tree/main/InteRecAgent

Microsoft RecAI is distributed under the MIT License. No source files from
RecAI are vendored in this repository. The concepts Query, Filter, Retrieval,
Ranking, candidate buffering, and plan-first recommendation are acknowledged
as upstream inspiration.

MovieLens data is provided separately by GroupLens and is not redistributed
in this repository. Users must follow the MovieLens usage terms.
